# 50 Cent: Bulletproof (56550042), Nova. DRAFT by lane.routeprep, 2026-09-26,
# not played. One file for both variants: the route never writes a profile
# (see "Continue without saving" below), so a first run and a later run see
# the same screens.
#
# Evidence: pass 1 (0-0-y-1790433159-titleplay-p1-50cent, Nova), frames in
# its route-frames/:
#   073540 intro FMV at 60 s; START -> 073546 title art (START skipped the FMV)
#   073552 "Title Screen" menu: New Game (highlighted) / Load Game / Options
#   073603 "Choose Difficulty", cursor on Thug (Normal)
#   073618 "- Create New Profile -" list, with the button bar
#          "X Continue without saving" and "A Create Profile"
#   073629.. A on it opens the keyboard; pass 1's A then typed "a" forever.
#
# The profile keyboard is not needed at all: X on the Create New Profile list
# is "Continue without saving". Nothing past that screen has been seen.
#
# Confidence per step: [seen] = the screen is in a pass-1 frame;
# [inferred] = follows from the frames; [guess] = not on disk.
wait 55
shot boot55
wait 5
mark booted
press START                 # [seen 073540->073546] skips the intro FMV
wait 6
shot title
press START                 # [inferred] pass 1 used A here; START is the title's own prompt
wait 6
shot title-menu             # expect: New Game highlighted [seen 073552]
press A                     # [seen 073552->073603] New Game
wait 6
shot difficulty             # expect: Thug (Normal) highlighted [seen 073603]
press A                     # [seen 073603->073618] Thug
wait 8
shot create-profile         # expect: "- Create New Profile -" [seen 073618]
press X                     # [seen: button bar] Continue without saving
wait 5
shot no-save                # OPEN: a "continue without saving? YES/NO" confirm may show here
press A                     # [guess] confirm; if there was no dialog this lands on the next screen
wait 8
shot after-confirm
mark profile-skipped
# [guess] from here: the opening cutscene. START/A are tried to skip it; the
# first mission's control is not seen, so this part surveys and the mark is
# a placeholder to move to where the frames show control.
repeat 8 {
    press A
    wait 8
    shot story
}
mark gameplay               # [guess] placeholder: move to the first frame with a HUD and 50 under control
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 1.5
    axis LY mid
    axis RX max
    wait 0.5
    axis RX mid
    axis RT max
    wait 0.3
    axis RT min
    axis LY min
    wait 1.5
    axis LY mid
    axis RX min
    wait 0.5
    axis RX mid
    axis RT max
    wait 0.3
    axis RT min
}
